WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:01.700
Hi, my name is Jeremy Lee,

00:01.700 --> 00:05.040
and this is my project,
an intelligent sleeve called CLYF.

00:05.360 --> 00:08.080
For climbers, we don't really know:
how long should we be resting?

00:08.080 --> 00:11.500
So I made this intelligent sleeve
that tracks your muscle signals

00:11.500 --> 00:14.640
and your muscle pressure
in your forearm.

00:14.840 --> 00:18.300
As you can see,
there's a battery here.

00:18.300 --> 00:23.040
When you start climbing or gripping,
you can see the battery decreasing.

00:24.400 --> 00:29.040
After a few seconds, say you get very tired,
you could come down off the wall.

00:29.200 --> 00:33.000
You just hands off, and you can see
that the battery is charging back.

00:34.680 --> 00:38.000
After it gets to a certain baseline
designed for your body—

00:38.760 --> 00:42.000
say it's like 80 here.
Let's just wait.

00:48.480 --> 00:52.240
Okay, now it's going,
so you should be climbing again.

00:53.040 --> 00:57.960
Okay, that's it. Thank you.
